RCV = variants('RC', 'Late Republican Roman Consular Army', {'Consular Army': (L(Characters=25, **{'Conscript_Legionaries': (25, 100), 'Experienced_Legionaries': 25, 'Auxiliaries_&_Support_Troops': 20}), 'Characters up to 25%. Legionaries: at least 25% must be Conscripts; up to 25% may be Experienced Legionaries. Auxiliaries and Support Troops up to 20% (one Scorpion per 1,000 points). If a consul is not chosen a Praetor may be made General (+25 pts). Designed for the Roman armies used in the Third Servile War; may also be used for other local municipal forces in the late Republic.')})
